type: software
title: "Echo Three"
authors:
  - family-names: Harms
    given-names: Richard
    affiliation: "Echo Three, LLC"
abstract: >-
  A Java EE application toolkit providing an extensible platform for customer
  management (CRM), product information management (PIM), content management
  (CMS), and other functionality. Integrates with other applications through
  a GraphQL API, Java EE EJBs, or a JSP tag library.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://gitlab.echothree.com/echothree/echothree"
url: "https://www.echothree.com/"
keywords:
  - Java
  - Java EE
  - CRM
  - PIM
  - CMS
  - GraphQL
